    'failure path: a non-retryable backend error (VALIDATION_ERROR) surfaces '
    'through the real pipeline as the inline Failure.message, re-enables '
    'Salvar, keeps the modal open, fires exactly one request (no retry — '
    "VALIDATION_ERROR isn't one of the 6 retryable codes), and never writes "
    'to the real entries Hive box',
